Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.23,0:00:25.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You catch anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.85,0:00:33.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I didn't mean to\Nsneak up on you like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.27,0:00:41.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My name's Nishida, and I'm a fisherman.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.21,0:00:43.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In the game, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.09,0:00:45.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Back in Japan,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.11,0:00:49.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was the head of network security for a\Ncompany called Toto High Speed Internet.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.67,0:00:50.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm Kirito.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.33,0:00:54.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, wasn't Toto the company that... Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.89,0:00:58.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We were the folks in charge of\Nnetwork security for this game.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.57,0:01:04.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a big one!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.43,0:01:07.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but I've cut bigger.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.73,0:01:10.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.13,0:01:14.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Awesome. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.13,0:01:17.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm good at catching\Nthem, but cooking them?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.19,0:01:18.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, not so good.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.99,0:01:21.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd love to make sashimi\Nor a nice stew out of them,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.77,0:01:24.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But what's the point when\NI don't have any soy sauce?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.07,0:01:29.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I could go for fish baked with soy sauce\Nright now, or with radishes with soy sauce.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.03,0:01:33.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, if you want, I just might be\Nable to help you out with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.93,0:01:35.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, say what?
