Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.05,0:03:16.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was an amazing meal.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.59,0:03:19.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had no idea you could get\Nsoy sauce in this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.23,0:03:21.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Actually, I made it myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.99,0:03:24.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you want, you can\Ntake some home with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.11,0:03:24.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.09,0:03:28.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Man, my taste buds bow down before you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.21,0:03:30.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Glad you liked it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.59,0:03:33.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By the way, how high\Nis your fishing skill?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.19,0:03:37.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm asking because Kirito hasn't\Nbeen able to catch anything yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.57,0:03:42.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, well, maybe if all the lakes\Non this floor weren't so hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.05,0:03:44.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, actually, that's not true.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.05,0:03:46.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As far as fishing goes,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.01,0:03:50.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the only lake that's tough to catch anything\Nin is the big one you were at today.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.71,0:03:51.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.91,0:03:54.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why would someone design it like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.49,0:03:55.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, good question.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.63,0:04:02.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That lake is the home of the\Nking of all fish. Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.15,0:04:04.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yep, we're old pals.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.35,0:04:08.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've had him on the end of\Nmy hook quite a few times.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.15,0:04:12.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But he's so strong, he yanks the pool\Nright out of my hands every time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.05,0:04:18.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was wondering, do you\Nhave any plans for tomorrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.91,0:04:26.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't mind helping the old guy out,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.07,0:04:30.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but how am I supposed to do a\Nswitch move with a fishing pole?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.55,0:04:33.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the only one I know\Nwho can figure it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.57,0:04:38.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What if you catch it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.87,0:04:39.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Will you keep it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.03,0:04:41.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that even possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.59,0:04:50.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He is pretty cool,\Nthough, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.59,0:04:53.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When you both showed up, I\Nwas like, who is this person?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.41,0:05:00.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isn't it funny how people are\Nliving normal lives in this world?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.15,0:05:03.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And since we're the\Nones on the front lines,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.99,0:05:07.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,their lives have sort of become\Nour responsibility, haven't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.91,0:05:12.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For me, I wasn't getting\Nstronger for anyone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.81,0:05:15.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was just about me staying alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.27,0:05:22.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone expects great\Nthings from you now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.99,0:05:24.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And guess what? So do I.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.71,0:05:27.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Talk about pressure, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.89,0:05:32.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I promised I'd save everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.53,0:05:35.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hell of a thing to live up to.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.89,0:05:38.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, well.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.59,0:05:41.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They'll understand if\Nyou take tonight off.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.83,0:05:42.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:48.38,0:05:50.39,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HFF&\blur1.5\fs90\fnDomFortress Casual\c&H3A3232&\3c&H3A3232&\pos(797.34,360.33)\fax-0.35\frx6\fry340\frz28.77}Go for it! {\alpha&H00&\fscx80\fnPaper Johnny Eins\bord8.25}Nishida
Dialogue: 2,0:05:48.38,0:05:50.39,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HFF&\blur1.5\fs90\fnDomFortress Casual\pos(797.34,360.33)\fax-0.35\frx6\fry340\frz28.77}Go for it! {\alpha&H00&\fscx80\fnPaper Johnny Eins\bord6\3c&H5E4ABE&\c&H5D4ABE&}Nishida
Dialogue: 3,0:05:48.38,0:05:50.39,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.5\fs90\fnDomFortress Casual\c&H433E3F&\pos(797.34,360.33)\fax-0.35\frx6\fry340\frz28.77}Go for it! {\fscx80\fnPaper Johnny Eins\c&H393232&}Nishida
Dialogue: 1,0:05:50.39,0:05:54.27,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fs33\blur1.05\fnArtificeSSK\c&H524041&\move(1080,153,1600.5,153)\frz359}Cat{\frz0}ch {\frz1}The {\frz2}Ki{\frz3}ng!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.17,0:05:53.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.49,0:05:57.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you believe all the\Npeople who showed up?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.41,0:06:01.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.51,0:06:03.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks for your patience, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.51,0:06:05.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here comes today's main event.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.23,0:06:06.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's about time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.65,0:06:09.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kirito, let's catch us a fish. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.79,0:06:15.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How big is this thing\Nsupposed to be anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.39,0:06:18.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, here goes nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.41,0:06:44.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, shouldn't you reel it in? No, not yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.95,0:06:49.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, Nishida? Hang on.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.25,0:06:50.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.65,0:06:53.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.71,0:06:55.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got this sucker!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.25,0:06:59.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, switch?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.25,0:07:06.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Call me here, you bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.83,0:07:10.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.74,0:07:11.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's coming up!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.87,0:07:20.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think I tired him out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.37,0:07:25.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where are you going? Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.65,0:07:30.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, no, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.01,0:07:32.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gito!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.41,0:07:34.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.27,0:07:37.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For what?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.33,0:07:52.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You ran away!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.69,0:07:54.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You left me there to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.77,0:07:55.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here it comes!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.81,0:07:59.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, we can run?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.23,0:08:02.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like a crazy lungfish. Kirito!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.05,0:08:04.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is serious!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.23,0:08:05.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That thing's coming for us!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.73,0:08:06.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry, do something!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.19,0:08:08.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm still thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.57,0:08:11.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guess I'll take care of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.41,0:08:16.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Run while you still can!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.47,0:08:17.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nah, she'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.09,0:08:20.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Save your wife, Kirito!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.85,0:08:23.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No! Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.17,0:08:37.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.33,0:08:39.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was badass!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.29,0:08:41.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're Asuna, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.17,0:08:43.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.35,0:08:44.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Man, this is awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.53,0:08:45.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a big fan of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.11,0:08:47.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can I shake your hand?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.19,0:08:50.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice job, honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.87,0:08:54.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Heathcliff.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.91,0:09:03.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.93,0:09:05.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've moped long enough already.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.81,0:09:08.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know, but it's only been two weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.97,0:09:12.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If he needs us on the front lines,\Nthen something must have happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.27,0:09:14.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why else would he interrupt our vacation?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.25,0:09:16.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but still.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.05,0:09:19.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's at least hear what he's got to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.31,0:09:21.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, time to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.93,0:09:31.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll take care of this,\Nthen come back. You got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.69,0:09:36.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks for seeing us off.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:36.32,0:09:41.33,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(479,500)\fsp-3\fscx95\fscy85\xshad1.5\yshad3\pos(961.5,945)\c&H121212&\4c&H04160E&\blur3\fs72\alpha&H40\3c&H091E1C&}November {\fscx105}7{\fscx95}th, {\fscx110}2024{\fscx95}   {\fscx110}22{\fscx95}nd Floor • Coral   Teleport Gate Plaza
Dialogue: 1,0:09:36.32,0:09:41.33,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(479,500)\fsp-3\fscx95\fscy85\xshad1.5\yshad3\pos(961.5,945)\c&H121212&\4c&H04160E&\blur3\fs72\alpha&H65}November {\fscx105}7{\fscx95}th, {\fscx110}2024{\fscx95}   {\fscx110}22{\fscx95}nd Floor • Coral   Teleport Gate Plaza
Dialogue: 2,0:09:36.32,0:09:41.33,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(479,500)\fscx95\fscy85\shad0\pos(960,942)\blur0.45\fs72\c&HF5F5F5&\fsp-3}November {\fscx105}7{\fscx95}th, {\fscx110}2024{\fscx95}   {\fscx110}22{\fscx95}nd Floor • Coral   Teleport Gate Plaza
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.39,0:09:40.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know we didn't get to spend much\Ntime together, but it was fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.51,0:09:43.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, well, it was an honor and a privilege.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.25,0:09:46.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Actually, before I met the two of you,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.45,0:09:49.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I couldn't imagine what the folks\Nworking to clear the game were like.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.99,0:09:52.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You might as well have\Nbeen from another planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.55,0:09:56.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Being trapped in here\Nfor the past two years,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.33,0:09:59.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,even if I made it out alive,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.43,0:10:02.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know if I can go back\Nto my old job, my old life.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.51,0:10:07.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe deep down inside, I've\Ngiven up hope of ever getting out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.87,0:10:09.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I figured spending my\Ntime with a fishing pole
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.01,0:10:12.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,between my mitts was\Nthe best thing for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.27,0:10:14.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pretty sad, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.95,0:10:15.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-uh.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.86,0:10:16.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That isn't sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.23,0:10:18.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I get what you mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.59,0:10:22.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I used to feel the same\Nas you, at first anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.97,0:10:24.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I felt lost and hopeless.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.25,0:10:27.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Every night I'd cry myself to sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.93,0:10:32.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It felt like each day that went by in here\Nwas another day lost from my real life.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.15,0:10:38.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so I'd cry and afterwards I'd\Ngo and fight as hard as I could.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.45,0:10:40.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All I cared about was winning.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.53,0:10:42.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Getting stronger and\Ngetting to the next floor,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.71,0:10:48.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but then I was walking along and I\Nsaw someone taking a nap in the shade.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.21,0:10:53.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was so mad, I told him he\Nshouldn't waste his time like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.37,0:10:55.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And then he said,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.51,0:10:58.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I'll never forget it—this\Nis Aincrad's best season—and
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.27,0:11:00.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,today's weather is?" weather is\NHe said it's optimal setting.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.85,0:11:05.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He said it'd be a waste to go into\Nsome dungeon on such a beautiful day.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.47,0:11:08.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I tried lying down\Ntoo, and you know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.11,0:11:09.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I slept like a baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.51,0:11:14.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I woke up, it was evening and\Nhe was giving me the weirdest look.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.75,0:11:19.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway, we formed our own party, and\Nthat's when I realized something.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.99,0:11:24.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even in a world like this,\Nhe was really living.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.39,0:11:27.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He wasn't losing a day in the real world.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.73,0:11:30.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was gaining a day. Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.19,0:11:33.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I learned so much from him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.47,0:11:35.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And by him, I mean Kirito.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.29,0:11:38.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I thought about him\Nbefore falling asleep,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.05,0:11:41.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I noticed I wouldn't have nightmares.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.47,0:11:44.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I began looking forward\Nto seeing him again.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.73,0:11:49.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was like, for the first\Ntime, I was glad I was here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.97,0:11:52.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kirito was everything to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.97,0:11:55.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's what the last two years were about.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.01,0:11:58.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's proof I'm alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.49,0:12:02.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why'd I put on the nerve gear that day?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.47,0:12:06.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's obvious, so I could\Ncome here and meet him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.49,0:12:08.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're still alive, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.01,0:12:11.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must have something to live for too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.85,0:12:13.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.05,0:12:16.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're absolutely right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.49,0:12:19.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Life isn't so bad here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.09,0:12:21.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, it's actually pretty.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.01,0:12:28.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wish there was something I could\Ndo to help, but well, there it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.75,0:12:31.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good luck and be safe. Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.43,0:12:32.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll go fishing again.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.45,0:12:34.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take care, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.23,0:12:40.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Teleport Gransom!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:53.43,0:12:56.40,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(479,0)\fsp-1.5\fscx95\fscy85\xshad1.5\yshad3\pos(964.5,945)\c&H121212&\4c&H171719&\blur3\fs72\alpha&H40\3c&H091E1C&}November {\fscx105}7{\fscx95}th, {\fscx110}2024{\fscx95}  {\fscx105}55{\fscx95}th Floor • Granzam
