Dialogue: 2,0:12:53.43,0:12:56.40,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(479,0)\fsp-1.5\fscx95\fscy85\shad0\pos(963,942)\blur0.45\fs72\c&HF5F5F5&}November {\fscx105}7{\fscx95}th, {\fscx110}2024{\fscx95}  {\fscx105}55{\fscx95}th Floor • Granzam
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.95,0:12:56.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The recon team was wiped out?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.49,0:12:58.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They were scouting for\Nthe upcoming boss fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.99,0:13:02.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was a party of 20 members,\Ntaken from five different guilds.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.35,0:13:05.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ten of them reached\Nthe center of the room.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.93,0:13:07.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then the boss appeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.35,0:13:13.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that's when the entrance closed,\Ncutting them off from the rest of the party.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.97,0:13:16.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They walked into an anti-crystal zone.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.09,0:13:17.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Precisely.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.00,0:13:22.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and it couldn't have been more than five\Nminutes or so when the door finally opened.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.95,0:13:24.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The room was empty.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.65,0:13:30.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There wasn't any trace left behind of the\Nten soldiers, or the boss. You're kidding!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.43,0:13:34.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now more than ever, clearing the game\Nshould be everyone's number one priority.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.33,0:13:37.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're going to launch an attack with\Nthe largest group we can assemble.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.83,0:13:42.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can count on us to fight with\Nyou, but this needs to be clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.71,0:13:44.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Austin's safety is my priority.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.37,0:13:48.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If things start to get hairy in\Nthere, I'm going to protect her.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.49,0:13:49.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not negotiable.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.35,0:13:53.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A person with something to\Nprotect is a strong ally to have.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.33,0:13:56.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm expecting a good fight from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.09,0:14:02.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Three more hours of waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.73,0:14:04.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What should we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.97,0:14:10.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.41,0:14:14.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's something I have to ask you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.71,0:14:17.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I don't want you getting mad at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.69,0:14:21.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Instead of going to the boss\Nfight, could you please stay here?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.75,0:14:24.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why would you ask that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.85,0:14:29.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We won't be able to use teleport crystals,\Nso there's no telling what could happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.53,0:14:31.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.95,0:14:36.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If anything happened to you, I— So you\Nwant to go to someplace dangerous, alone,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.17,0:14:39.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and you expect me to stay\Nhere, where it's safe?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.53,0:14:46.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know what would happen\Nif you didn't come back, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.75,0:14:49.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd kill myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.03,0:14:55.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd never forgive myself for staying behind,\Nso what would be the point in living?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.31,0:15:02.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, I guess I'm losing my nerve;\Nall I want to do is run away with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.53,0:15:06.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't care if we never make\Nit back to the real world;
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.19,0:15:07.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just want to live with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.95,0:15:09.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,in our little house in the woods.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.65,0:15:13.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'd be nice if we could do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.97,0:15:16.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be together, every day, forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.13,0:15:22.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you ever thought about what's\Nhappening in the real world?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.39,0:15:25.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,About what's happening to our\Nbodies while we're in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.31,0:15:31.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A few weeks after the game was\Nlaunched, do you remember what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.13,0:15:35.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Most of the players suddenly went offline\Nand stayed that way for a few hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.29,0:15:38.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My guess is that's when\Nall the players' bodies
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.91,0:15:41.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,were being moved to\Nhospitals in the real world.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.45,0:15:45.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If that's where we all are\Nright now in hospitals,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.55,0:15:47.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,barely being kept alive by machines,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.81,0:15:51.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's hard to believe we're going to\Nsurvive like that for much longer,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.11,0:15:56.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so that means it doesn't matter whether\Nwe clear the game or not anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.71,0:16:00.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone here is on a time\Nlimit, and once that's up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.41,0:16:06.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.32,0:16:07.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.63,0:16:09.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to stay with you forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.09,0:16:14.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want us to go on real dates.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.91,0:16:16.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And to really get married.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.21,0:16:19.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And for us to grow old together.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.41,0:16:22.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.77,0:16:23.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that's why…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.67,0:16:28.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't have a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.75,0:16:30.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to keep fighting.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:34.36,0:16:37.95,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(650,0)\fsp-1.5\fscy85\xshad1.5\yshad3\pos(961.5,945)\c&H121212&\4c&H181D1E&\blur3\fs72\alpha&H40\3c&H091E1C&\fscx105}75{\fscx95}th Floor • Collinia  Teleport Gate Plaza
Dialogue: 1,0:16:34.36,0:16:37.95,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(650,0)\fsp-1.5\fscy85\xshad1.5\yshad3\pos(961.5,945)\c&H121212&\4c&H181D1E&\blur3\fs72\alpha&H45\fscx105}75{\fscx95}th Floor • Collinia  Teleport Gate Plaza
Dialogue: 2,0:16:34.36,0:16:37.95,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(650,0)\fsp-1.5\fscy85\shad0\pos(960,942)\blur0.45\fs72\c&HF5F5F5&\fscx105}75{\fscx95}th Floor • Collinia  Teleport Gate Plaza
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.43,0:16:53.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.43,0:16:56.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.57,0:16:57.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys are coming too?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.27,0:16:59.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the best you got?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.59,0:17:00.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.71,0:17:04.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, man, I shut my shop down to\Ncome out here and help get this done.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.65,0:17:08.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Brother, you're looking at a player who's\Nabout as philanthropic as they come.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.25,0:17:10.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then seeing as how\Nyou're so philanthropic,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.45,0:17:12.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you're not gonna mind if we\Ntake you off the drop list.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.43,0:17:14.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, hey now, let's\Nnot be too hasty, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.25,0:17:32.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Corridor, open.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.57,0:17:37.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.15,0:17:46.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Feel that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.45,0:17:48.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a bad vibe in here. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.27,0:18:00.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.57,0:18:04.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Knights of the Blood\Nwill be out in front,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.97,0:18:07.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,distracting the boss and\Nblocking its attacks.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.27,0:18:08.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In the meantime,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.63,0:18:13.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the rest of you have to stay sharp and\Ntry to figure out its attack patterns.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.63,0:18:16.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't lie, this battle will be hard,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.29,0:18:19.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I have faith that\Nwe can and will prevail.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.79,0:18:21.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For our day of liberation.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.03,0:18:40.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everything's gonna be fine. I\Nwon't let anything happen to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.35,0:18:43.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,promise—make sure you protect me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.23,0:18:46.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Too, okay, yeah, you know, I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.81,0:18:47.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.55,0:18:55.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,die, guys—same to you, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.07,0:18:58.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna make a fortune\Noff today's drops.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.29,0:19:01.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,today's drops No way am\NI missing out on that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.07,0:19:05.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Forward to battle!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.61,0:19:32.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing's happening. Where is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.57,0:19:40.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Up there!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.49,0:19:47.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the skull. Reaper.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.07,0:19:53.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stay away from it! Red up!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.11,0:19:55.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This way!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.41,0:19:57.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry, run!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.15,0:20:12.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was one hit.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.17,0:20:14.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Man, we are so dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.65,0:20:39.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't even get in close\Nenough to hit the damn thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.53,0:20:41.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.55,0:20:45.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's too strong!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.75,0:20:54.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we block it together, we have a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.91,0:20:57.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, we can do this! Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.05,0:21:01.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Me and Alne, deal with the signs!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.67,0:21:03.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone else, flank it and attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.39,0:21:06.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You heard the man! Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.73,0:21:11.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold still, baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.69,0:21:18.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.39,0:21:33.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ready, Kirito? Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.05,0:22:00.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah! Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.41,0:22:03.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God!
